            "review_title": "Review at Sushimaru",
            "review_text": "地デジオヤジ\nNara, Japan541 contributions\n0\nSatisfactory Sushi Quality at a Sushi Restaurant in Yunan\nMay 2026 • Couples\nVisit for lunch. Order a sushi set. Sushi has a decent level of perfection. Rice is also reasonably good. Miso soup was the only thing that was a mess. It was a sushi restaurant that I could use every day, which was satisfying enough. In addition, I ordered an eel roll, which was excellent.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten May 24, 2026",
