            "review_text": "TMicahT9\nMetro Minneapolis-Saint Paul, Minnesota719 contributions\n0\nFresh and delicious. Wonderful dining experience.\nFeb 2023 • Family\nFour of us dropped by on a Wednesday when SushiMaru was opening. The restaurant is a charming little restaurant with minimalist Japanese aesthetics and spotlessly clean. Service was warm and friendly. Most importantly, sushi was fresh and delicious. Great sake as well. Don’t miss the delicious dessert. Not too sweet - in other words, delicious in Asian speak. Highly recommended.\nRead more\nWritten February 15, 2023",
